SUMMARY:CANCELLED:  Park at Flat Rock
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\n**CANCELLED: Flat Rock Pk**\nCancelled: Win
 d chill: 29º\; 16+mph wind\; partly cloudy\; and 60% humidity will drive 
 the cold into your bones. No\, no\, no !!!!!\n\n**Description:**\nthe 66-a
 cre park has a flat\, open green space and a 1.3 mile trail (shortcuts ava
 ilable) that you can walk or run.\nhttps://flatrockparkfoundation.org/the-
 park/\nDifficulty: Easy\, peasy\nSuitable for beginners? Yes\nWe are the S
 loth Walking Team: “We will get there when we get there.”\n**Up to 12 
 ppl** are welcome to join us.\n**https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bsh_8qxUf
 DY**\nLength: <1.5 mi\; Total ascent: 25 ft\nApprx return time: 11 AM\nOpt
 ional: Some will walk 2 laps…\n**Optional:** Lunch @ TBD. (Treskas??)\n*
 *This is a dog-participant walk.** This event is NOT for those who are unc
 omfortable with the antics of fun-loving dogs. Dogs are welcome (IF their 
 masters are well trained). 'On leash' rules apply.\nWeather Check: Henders
 onville\, NC\nAll walks are at your own risk. You are responsible for your
  OWN safety and adequate equipment.\nWaiver: There are certain risks inher
 ent in any outdoor activity. Each participant\, by signing up to attend th
 is event\, agrees to release from liability the leader(s)\, Hendo Fun Frie
 nds\, its Partners\, Affiliates\, and members for any accident\, injury\, 
 illness\, or personal loss which might occur while participating in this a
 ctivity or while traveling in any vehicle during this trip. Each participa
 nt further agrees to abide by the rules and regulations concerning safety\
 , to follow instructions of the leader(s)\, and not to become intentionall
 y separated from the group. The leader(s) also has the right to use any im
 ages collected on this trip for recording on website photo collections.\ng
 ordie's contact: CurmudgeonHiker@gmail.com\n(**before** day of hike): 828.
 393.0297 (text only)\n**Pics: https://www.flickr.com/photos/146993931@N05/
 albums**
