SUMMARY:Domino Game Afternoon (3rd Sun)
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nYou are convivially invited to an afternoon
  of raucous laughter and abandon while playing the game(s) of Mule Train D
 ominoes (a simplified version of Mexican Train Dominoes.) This version of 
 "Mexican Train" was developed by cheating during the long cold Winter of W
 isconsin.\n***Social hour at 1:30 PM\; Games start at 2 PM***\nI will have
  up to 3 game tables reserved.\n**NOTE:** if you park in ‘metered parkin
 g’\, carry your parking tag – Dry Falls will give you a $credit.\nEnjo
 y a large\, climate-controlled indoor area.\nAsst’d beers\, wines\, wate
 r & soft drinks available.\nA Mexican Food Truck is available\n**You are e
 ncouraged to purchase drink at the venue.**\nhttps://dryfallsbrewing.com/\
 nOptional: You may bring (non-messy) finger food. (to share if you like).\
 ngordie's contact: CurmudgeonHiker@gmail.com\n828.393.0297 (text only)
